# GET /hello for the IntelliJ HTTP Client. Pick "local" or "test" from http-client.env.json.

### Lambda and database are up
GET {{base_url}}/hello

> {%
  client.test("database is UP", () => {
    client.assert(response.status === 200, "status " + response.status);
    client.assert(response.body.database === "UP", "database " + response.body.database);
  });
%}
